#: src/SEO/Local/LocalSeoController.php:95
msgid ""
"A Location is a public page for a shop, office, restaurant, clinic, branch or"
" other physical place. YSEO turns the saved address, contact details, "
"coordinates and opening hours into LocalBusiness Schema and local discovery "
"files."
msgstr ""
"En Location er en offentlig side for en butik, et kontor, en restaurant, en "
"klinik, en filial eller et andet fysisk sted. YSEO omsætter den gemte "
"adresse, kontaktoplysninger, koordinater og åbningstider til LocalBusiness "
"Schema og lokale discovery-filer."

#: src/Analysis/ContentOptimizationAnalyzer.php:540
msgid "A WordPress modified timestamp is available for this resource."
msgstr "Et WordPress-tidsstempel for ændring er tilgængeligt for denne ressource."

#: src/Admin/SeoEditorController.php:588
msgid ""
"A bounded sample of recently modified public resources shows how the active "
"guidance profile behaves on real saved content. Treat it as local "
"optimization-readiness evidence."
msgstr ""
"Et afgrænset udsnit af nyligt ændrede offentlige ressourcer viser, hvordan "
"den aktive vejledningsprofil fungerer på reelt gemt indhold. Betragt det som "
"lokal evidens for optimeringsberedskab."

#: src/Admin/AdminController.php:1102
msgid ""
"A cache-busted sitemap is correct but the canonical URL is stale. Purge "
"sitemap caches, then test again."
msgstr ""
"Et cache-bustet sitemap er korrekt, men den kanoniske URL er forældet. Ryd "
"sitemap-caches, og test igen."

#: src/Admin/AdminController.php:685 src/Admin/SeoEditorController.php:785
msgid ""
"A cacheable XML discovery map points machines to bounded JSON-LD aggregation "
"endpoints for each public post type. Canonical HTML remains the page-level "
"authority."
msgstr ""
"Et cachebart XML-discovery-kort peger maskiner mod afgrænsede JSON-LD-"
"aggregationsendpoints for hver offentlig indholdstype. Kanonisk HTML "
"forbliver autoriteten på sideniveau."

#: src/Diagnostics/ReleaseReadinessAudit.php:23
msgid ""
"A competing provider keeps YSEO in Shadow; explicit YSEO authority remains "
"optional."
msgstr ""
"En konkurrerende udbyder holder YSEO i Shadow; udtrykkelig YSEO-autoritet "
"forbliver valgfri."

#: src/Analysis/ContentOptimizationAnalyzer.php:420
msgid "A concise summary is available through the meta description or excerpt."
msgstr "Et kort resumé er tilgængeligt via metabeskrivelsen eller uddraget."

#: src/Analysis/ContentOptimizationAnalyzer.php:120
