msgstr ""
"YSEO analyserer synligt gemt indhold. Publicering af answer-blocks forbliver "
"editorstyret, og AEO-scoren er en gennemsigtig lokal beredskabsheuristik."

#: src/Integrations/SiteKit/SearchPerformanceController.php:149
msgid ""
"YSEO counts privacy-minimised organic landing entrances locally using cookie-"
"free, IP-free local evidence. Search impressions, query text and average "
"ranking position live on the search-engine side and therefore use an "
"authorized connector such as Search Console or another future provider."
msgstr ""
"YSEO tæller privacy-minimerede organiske landingsindgange lokalt ved hjælp af"
" cookie-fri, IP-fri lokal evidens. Søgeeksponeringer, query-tekst og "
"gennemsnitlig rankingposition findes på søgemaskinesiden og bruger derfor en "
"autoriseret connector som Search Console eller en fremtidig udbyder."

#: src/Admin/SeoEditorController.php:618
msgid ""
"YSEO can publish a root /llms.txt plus optional scoped /section/llms.txt "
"files. Each eligible resource keeps its own clean .md alternate, while the "
"normal HTML URL remains canonical."
msgstr ""
"YSEO kan publicere en root /llms.txt plus valgfrie scoped /section/llms.txt-"
"filer. Hver kvalificeret ressource beholder sit eget rene .md-alternativ, "
"mens den normale HTML-URL forbliver kanonisk."

#: src/Admin/SeoEditorController.php:616
msgid ""
"External CDN/WAF policy remains an edge-layer source of truth. If this site "
"uses Cloudflare and you want Search allowed while Training is refused, verify"
" Cloudflare uses Disallow AI Training instead of Training=Block or Block on "
"pages with ads."
msgstr ""
"Ekstern CDN/WAF-politik forbliver en source of truth på edge-laget. Hvis "
"dette site bruger Cloudflare, og du vil tillade Search mens Training afvises,"
" skal du verificere, at Cloudflare bruger Disallow AI Training i stedet for "
"Training=Block eller Block på sider med annoncer."

#: src/Admin/SeoEditorController.php:1137
msgid ""
"ClaimReview generation is reserved for genuine fact-check workflows where "
"another consumer, such as Fact Check Explorer, still uses it."
msgstr ""
"ClaimReview-generering er reserveret til ægte fact-check-workflows, hvor en "
"anden forbruger, såsom Fact Check Explorer, stadig bruger det."

#: src/Admin/AdminController.php:768
msgid ""
"Permanent-removal semantics remain explicit. Choose 410 or 451 in Redirect "
"Manager when that semantic is intended."
msgstr ""
"Semantik for permanent fjernelse forbliver eksplicit. Vælg 410 eller 451 i "
"Redirect Manager, når denne semantik er tilsigtet."

#: src/SEO/NotFound/NotFoundAdminController.php:164
msgid ""
"YSEO emits privacy-light non-SEO evidence for a security provider. A "
"connected provider can consume new observations and historical batches, then "
"assume evidence ownership locally. Blocking, CAPTCHA and rate limits remain "
"security responsibilities."
msgstr ""
"YSEO udsender privacy-light ikke-SEO-evidens til en sikkerhedsudbyder. En "
"forbundet udbyder kan forbruge nye observationer og historiske batches og "
"derefter overtage evidensejerskab lokalt. Blokering, CAPTCHA og rate limits "
"forbliver sikkerhedsansvar."

#: src/Admin/SeoEditorController.php:378
msgid ""
"YSEO emits verification meta tags only while it owns public SEO output. "
"Verification-tag rendering remains local."
msgstr ""
"YSEO udsender kun verification-meta-tags, mens det ejer offentligt SEO-"
"output. Rendering af verification-tags forbliver lokal."

#: src/Analysis/ReadabilityAnalyzer.php:53
msgid ""
"YSEO evaluates sentence and paragraph structure for this language. Reading-"
"ease scoring activates when a calibrated local formula is bundled."
msgstr ""
"YSEO evaluerer sætnings- og afsnitsstruktur for dette sprog. "
"Læsevenlighedsscore aktiveres, når en kalibreret lokal formel er medfølgende."

